      "writtenOn": "2026-01-29T02:52:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah ok, I guess there was some confusion on our end thing we should keep UPSTREAM changes on AOSP and only have downstream changes on our downstream branch.\n\nI also don\u0027t see misc/mei (CONFIG_MEI) in the GKI builds either, so the entire CL chain should just land on our downstream branch as well? and ignore your CR+2 on the misc/mei CLs?",
      "parentUuid": "36bece3d_99f4ac82",
      "revId": "05a27c9e5d2e97d5e429178b5980781e10f99f4a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
