      "writtenOn": "2026-01-29T19:29:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ahh I see now that INTEL_MEI is defaulted on for x86 and I guess they only touch the Kconfigs for the other modules we build downstream CONFIG_INTEL_MEI_GSC_*, INTEL_MEI_PXP, INTEL_MEI_HDCP",
      "parentUuid": "304fb007_152fcbb0",
      "revId": "05a27c9e5d2e97d5e429178b5980781e10f99f4a",
